Package: web2board
Version: 2.1.3
Section: electronics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Eduardo Millán <eduardo.millan@bitbloq.local>
Description: Web2Board - compile & flash service for Bitbloq.
 Web2Board is the background service that compiles Bitbloq programs and
 flashes them to the board over USB. It listens on ws://127.0.0.1:9877 and
 is normally launched automatically by Bitbloq Offline. This package provides
 it as a standalone, self-contained binary (no Python/PySide system deps).
 Homepage: https://github.com/eduardomillan/bitbloq-offline-24
